@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    // Set the title of the page to "About Us"
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}
<div class="about-us">
<h1 class="about-us-title">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
    <!-- Description of the website's purpose, focusing on plushies inspired by characters from the "Cars" movie -->
    <p>Our website is a delightful online store dedicated to selling high-quality plushies inspired by the beloved characters from the "Cars" movie. Whether you're a Lightning McQueen fan or have a soft spot for Tow Mater, our collection brings these iconic characters to life in a soft, huggable form. Each plushie is crafted with attention to detail, perfect for fans of all ages who want a cozy reminder of the fun and adventure of "Cars." With a range of designs and characters, there’s something for every "Cars" enthusiast to love!</p>
